      "text": "- First launch: three swipeable intro cards (Save -> Highlight\n  -> Remember) with small animations.\n- Try the sample article: ships with the app, opens offline, one\n  line already highlighted.\n- Use Stack with no account: everything works offline on the\n  phone.\n- Animated splash: the Stack logo builds itself block by block.",
