      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791698471608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 12 topics: Top, Video, India, World, Tech, AI, Dev, Business,\n  Science, Sports, Entertainment, Health.\n- Sources: BBC, The Hindu, Times of India, Indian Express, Al\n  Jazeera, Mint, The Guardian, Hacker News, dev.to.\n- My feeds: add any RSS/Atom feed, or just a website like css-\n  tricks.com.\n- Your news: follow words across every topic; mute words and\n  sources.\n- Your profile interests put your topics first.\n- Flash cards (swipe up for the next story) or a list, with date\n  and time on every story.\n- Pull to refresh: the Stack logo stacks itself while it loads.\n- Video: news channels' latest reports in YouTube's privacy-\n  enhanced player.\n- Today's paper: free newspapers and magazines from official\n  sources.\n- Save a story, or share it as a link or a picture card.\n- Search inside News.\n- Breaking-news alerts per topic, at most one an hour, with a\n  test alert (Android).",
      "originalText": "- 12 topics: Top, Video, India, World, Tech, AI, Dev, Business,\n  Science, Sports, Entertainment, Health.\n- Sources: BBC, The Hindu, Times of India, Indian Express, Al\n  Jazeera, Mint, The Guardian, Hacker News, dev.to.\n- My feeds: add any RSS/Atom feed, or just a website like css-\n  tricks.com.\n- Your news: follow words across every topic; mute words and\n  sources.\n- Your profile interests put your topics first.\n- Flash cards (swipe up for the next story) or a list, with date\n  and time on every story.\n- Pull to refresh: the Stack logo stacks itself while it loads.\n- Video: news channels' latest reports in YouTube's privacy-\n  enhanced player.\n- Today's paper: free newspapers and magazines from official\n  sources.\n- Save a story, or share it as a link or a picture card.\n- Search inside News.\n- Breaking-news alerts per topic, at most one an hour, with a\n  test alert (Android).",
