      "text": "- Clean reader mode: no ads, no clutter, no hidden screen-reader\n  junk.\n- Summarize (AI): three bullets and a takeaway; Hindi with one\n  tap.\n- Translate: read the article in Hindi or more languages.\n- Listen: read aloud by the phone's voice in the music player,\n  with speed and sleep timer.\n- Download for offline; today's top stories are kept offline for\n  3 days.\n- Open the original on the news site.\n- Select text: Highlight, + Note, Share, Meaning, Explain.",
      "originalText": "- Clean reader mode: no ads, no clutter, no hidden screen-reader\n  junk.\n- Summarize (AI): three bullets and a takeaway; Hindi with one\n  tap.\n- Translate: read the article in Hindi or more languages.\n- Listen: read aloud by the phone's voice in the music player,\n  with speed and sleep timer.\n- Download for offline; today's top stories are kept offline for\n  3 days.\n- Open the original on the news site.\n- Select text: Highlight, + Note, Share, Meaning, Explain.",
