      "text": "- PDFs and EPUB books on coloured shelves.\n- On this phone: every PDF on the phone, or one folder you pick\n  (Android).\n- Import from Telegram: connect your own bot, forward PDFs, pick\n  what to add.\n- Saved articles: stories you bookmarked or shared into Stack.\n- Covers: first page, any page, a photo, or a plain Stack cover;\n  progress and bookmark ribbon.",
