      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791698471608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Swipe or Prev / Next to turn pages; zoom in or fit to width.\n- Page view: Normal, Sepia, Dark or Grey; contrast and\n  brightness sliders.\n- Go to: search the whole text, the table of contents, or a page\n  number.\n- Bookmarks with labels.\n- Highlights and page notes, saved with the page number.\n- Handwriting: pen, highlighter and eraser; on tablets only the\n  stylus draws.\n- Sticky notes: note, question or flag; 3 sizes, 4 colours;\n  typed or handwritten.\n- Drag a sticky to move it; tap it to flip it up and see the\n  page underneath; show or hide all.\n- Reading time left in the book.\n- Ask this PDF (AI): answers cite pages, tap to jump there.\n- Listen from this page; start a focus session with this PDF.\n- NEW - Share PDF with your notes: highlights, handwriting and\n  sticky notes go with the file.\n- NEW - In the shared PDF every sticky note opens as a comment\n  in Acrobat, Drive, Xodo...\n- EPUB books: chapters work like pages (bookmarks, notes,\n  highlights, search, progress).",
      "originalText": "- Swipe or Prev / Next to turn pages; zoom in or fit to width.\n- Page view: Normal, Sepia, Dark or Grey; contrast and\n  brightness sliders.\n- Go to: search the whole text, the table of contents, or a page\n  number.\n- Bookmarks with labels.\n- Highlights and page notes, saved with the page number.\n- Handwriting: pen, highlighter and eraser; on tablets only the\n  stylus draws.\n- Sticky notes: note, question or flag; 3 sizes, 4 colours;\n  typed or handwritten.\n- Drag a sticky to move it; tap it to flip it up and see the\n  page underneath; show or hide all.\n- Reading time left in the book.\n- Ask this PDF (AI): answers cite pages, tap to jump there.\n- Listen from this page; start a focus session with this PDF.\n- NEW - Share PDF with your notes: highlights, handwriting and\n  sticky notes go with the file.\n- NEW - In the shared PDF every sticky note opens as a comment\n  in Acrobat, Drive, Xodo...\n- EPUB books: chapters work like pages (bookmarks, notes,\n  highlights, search, progress).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
