      "text": "- Highlight: the line is kept and comes back in the daily\n  review.\n- + Note: write your thought under the quote.\n- Share: the line as a picture card or plain text.\n- Meaning (one word): definitions, a Hindi meaning, save to My\n  words, share as a card.\n- Explain (AI): the line in simple words, saveable as a note.",
