      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791698471608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Keep-style editor: title, text, checklists, colours, pin,\n  autosave.\n- Fonts: five built in, or add your own font file.\n- Tags, links between notes, and reminders.\n- Delete with Undo.\n- Filters: All, My notes, Lists, Articles, PDFs, My words,\n  Music; plus search.\n- Every highlight remembers its source: tap to go back to the\n  exact page.\n- Quote cards: any note or highlight as a picture, in your\n  colour and shape.\n- Import highlights from Kindle (My Clippings.txt) or Readwise\n  (CSV or API).\n- Export to Markdown (Obsidian, Logseq...) or straight into\n  Notion.",
      "originalText": "- Keep-style editor: title, text, checklists, colours, pin,\n  autosave.\n- Fonts: five built in, or add your own font file.\n- Tags, links between notes, and reminders.\n- Delete with Undo.\n- Filters: All, My notes, Lists, Articles, PDFs, My words,\n  Music; plus search.\n- Every highlight remembers its source: tap to go back to the\n  exact page.\n- Quote cards: any note or highlight as a picture, in your\n  colour and shape.\n- Import highlights from Kindle (My Clippings.txt) or Readwise\n  (CSV or API).\n- Export to Markdown (Obsidian, Logseq...) or straight into\n  Notion.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
