      "updated": 1791698471608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Three old highlights come back each day on a spaced schedule.\n- Answer Got it, Show again soon, or Stop.\n- Words saved from Meaning come back too.\n- Morning notification with that day's highlights (Android).\n- Home screen widget: a highlight to recall, your streak and the\n  PDF in progress.",
      "originalText": "- Three old highlights come back each day on a spaced schedule.\n- Answer Got it, Show again soon, or Stop.\n- Words saved from Meaning come back too.\n- Morning notification with that day's highlights (Android).\n- Home screen widget: a highlight to recall, your streak and the\n  PDF in progress.",
      "fontSize": 20,
