      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791698471608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Pick what to read, then 15, 25, 45 or 60 minutes.\n- Pomodoro: 4 x 25 minutes, 5-minute breaks and a 15-minute long\n  break.\n- Music while you focus; quick notes during the session.\n- Pause or end; a small live timer shows on other screens.\n- Time's up notification when Stack is in the background.\n- Summary at the end: pages, highlights, notes and your streak.",
      "originalText": "- Pick what to read, then 15, 25, 45 or 60 minutes.\n- Pomodoro: 4 x 25 minutes, 5-minute breaks and a 15-minute long\n  break.\n- Music while you focus; quick notes during the session.\n- Pause or end; a small live timer shows on other screens.\n- Time's up notification when Stack is in the background.\n- Summary at the end: pages, highlights, notes and your streak.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
