      "text": "- Songs on the phone on a spinning record, the title on its\n  label.\n- Background play, lock screen and notification controls.\n- Shuffle, repeat, speed, sleep timer, +/-10 s, Up next queue.\n- Play next / Add to queue / Add to playlist on any song.\n- Your own playlists with cover images (they sync to your other\n  phone).\n- Free music online (Audius): search, trending, genres, recent\n  searches.\n- Mini player above the tab bar on every screen.",
      "originalText": "- Songs on the phone on a spinning record, the title on its\n  label.\n- Background play, lock screen and notification controls.\n- Shuffle, repeat, speed, sleep timer, +/-10 s, Up next queue.\n- Play next / Add to queue / Add to playlist on any song.\n- Your own playlists with cover images (they sync to your other\n  phone).\n- Free music online (Audius): search, trending, genres, recent\n  searches.\n- Mini player above the tab bar on every screen.",
      "fontSize": 20,
