      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791698471608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Continue with Google, or email and password.\n- Sync: notes, saved articles, PDFs, playlists, feeds, focus\n  history and profile.\n- Local-first: works offline; changes upload when you're back\n  online.\n- Backup everything to one file (with or without PDFs), no\n  account needed; restore adds it back.\n- Privacy policy inside the app; delete your account from the\n  app.\n- Only an anonymous daily visitor count, no content or IP.",
      "originalText": "- Continue with Google, or email and password.\n- Sync: notes, saved articles, PDFs, playlists, feeds, focus\n  history and profile.\n- Local-first: works offline; changes upload when you're back\n  online.\n- Backup everything to one file (with or without PDFs), no\n  account needed; restore adds it back.\n- Privacy policy inside the app; delete your account from the\n  app.\n- Only an anonymous daily visitor count, no content or IP.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
